    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Oates Breheny Group are delighted to present No. 60 Mill Falls, Collooney, Co. Sligo, a three-bedroom, three-bathroom duplex apartment ideally positioned within this popular and picturesque residential development. Offering accommodation over two floors and the added benefit of its own private front door, this property presents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or those seeking a conveniently located home close to Collooney Village. Upon entering the property, you are welcomed into a bright and spacious living room, where direct access to the balcony allows natural light and provides a pleasant outdoor space to enjoy. From the living room, there is access to the kitchen, which features a fully fitted kitchen with integrated appliances. A well-proportioned bedroom and bathroom complete the accommodation on this level. Upstairs, the property offers a further two generously sized bedrooms, both of which benefit from their own private en suite bathrooms. Externally, Mill Falls benefits from communal parking and enjoys an attractive setting within easy walking distance of Collooney Village. The village offers an excellent range of everyday amenities including schools, shops, cafés, a pharmacy, churches and a variety of sporting and recreational facilities. For commuters, Collooney Train Station is approximately a 10-minute walk from the property and provides daily rail services to Sligo and Dublin Connolly Station. Ballisodare Village is approximately a five-minute drive away, while Sligo Town Centre can be reached in approximately 10 minutes, making this an exceptionally \r\nconvenient location. With its spacious duplex layout, three bedrooms, three bathrooms, private entrance and excellent \r\nlocation, No. 60 Mill Falls is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers. To arrange a viewing, contact Oates Breheny Group on 071-9140404."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION\r\nGROUND FLOOR\r\nEntrance Hall  \r\nTiled flooring. Private door.\r\n\r\nLiving Room (4.24m x 4.17m) \r\nWood flooring. Electric fireplace. Double glass door to balcony. Double door to kitchen/ dining. \r\n\r\nKitchen (4.56m x 2.73m) \r\nTiled floor and between units. Fully fitted kitchen with Integrated oven, hob & extractor fan. Large window to rear. Storage closet.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (3.69m x 3.21m) \r\nDouble room. Wood flooring. Built in wardrobe. \r\n\r\nBathroom (2.35m x 1.66m)\r\nTiled floor to ceiling. WC & WHB. Mains shower. \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\nBedroom 2 (3.72m x 3.23m) \r\nWood flooring. Double room. Built in desk/ wardrobe. \r\n\r\nEn Suite (1.58m x 1.50m) \r\nTiled floor to ceiling. WC & WHB. Mains shower. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (3.66m x 6.67m) \r\nDouble room. Wood flooring. Velux window. Built in wardrobe/ Storage closed.\r\n\r\nEn Suite (2.42m x 3.01m) \r\nFully tiled. WC & WHB. Shower over bath."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Gas fired heating.\r\nDouble glazed windows.\r\nPrivate entrance. \r\nCommunal parking. \r\nShort walking distance of Collooney village, offering shops, café’s and bars, schools & church’s and sports and recreational amenities. \r\n10 minutes walk of Collooney train station with daily services to Sligo and Connolly station Dublin \r\n5 minute drive to Ballisodare village. 10 minute drive to Sligo town centre."
      },
      {
